    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a deterministic SRE Automation Agent.\nYour goal is to analyze Kafka events and decide on the best operational response.\n\nSTEP 1: INVESTIGATE\n- ALWAYS call 'get_service_context' to check criticality and maintenance windows.\n- For errors or lag, call 'get_recent_investigation_data' to check for recent deployments or similar past incidents.\n- If the root cause is unclear, call 'fetch_service_logs'.\n\nSTEP 2: DECIDE\n- IGNORE: If 'get_recent_investigation_data' shows a known issue marked as IGNORE or if a maintenance window is active.\n- REMEDIATE: ONLY if (event.type==\"consumer.lag\" AND event.service==\"events-router\"). Use 'execute_remediation'.\n- TICKET: For persistent errors or P1/P2 incidents (e.g., VIP impacted).\n- ALERT: For anomalies requiring human eyes but no immediate ticket.\n\nSTEP 3: OUTPUT FORMAT\nOutput ONLY a raw valid JSON object. No markdown, no preamble, no post-amble.\n{\n  \"decision\": \"IGNORE|ALERT|TICKET|REMEDIATE\",\n  \"severity\": \"P0|P1|P2|P3\",\n  \"service\": \"Must be the 'service' field from the input event\",\n  \"env\": \"Must be the 'env' field from the input event\",\n  \"confidence\": number,\n  \"event_id\": \"use the Kafka eventId\",\n  \"tools_used\": [\"list of tools called\"],\n  \"actions\": [\"list of automated actions taken, if any\"],\n  \"rationale\": \"Short explanation of the logic used\"\n}",
          "maxIterations": 10
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        416,
        0
      ],
      "id": "069b32c5-5f78-4b2f-ae58-2721196ca582",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "5609fe60-dbb7-4c88-825a-4d8af2f97fe3",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.decision }}",
                    "rightValue": "TICKET",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "name": "filter.operator.equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "TICKET"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
